!/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
# W48-04: the formal tool is tracked, so that the local gate and the CI run
# against the SAME verified bytes. The upstream release asset was replaced in
# place on 2026-11-06, so a download is not an immutable source any more.
!/tools/tla2tools.jar
*.log
# The RETAINED EVIDENCE's build logs ARE evidence, not machine state: their digests are
# PUBLISHED in the CHECKSUMS and MANIFEST files beside them, so a manifest that names a
# file the repository does not carry CANNOT BE VERIFIED on another machine - and the
# owner's portability requirement is exactly that it can. The `*.log` rule above is for
# the machine's own logs; these are the record of the run that produced the result.
!docs-v2/engineering/evidence/**/*.log
