# RECON-W38.0 — data/ is ignored wholesale, but ProfessionalBaselineTest asserts the
# live store EXISTS and fails rather than skipping. An ignored fixture is a test that
# passes only on the machine that already has it. The baseline store is 285 KB and is
# the specification of what the system knows at startup, so it is tracked.
